# Copy to .env.local for Vite.

# Supabase (required for auth + data)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=   # alternative to publishable key

# Firebase Storage = upload demo files only (no Firebase Auth). Store the returned URL in Supabase (submissions.video_url or assets.video_url).
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=

# Optional: omit VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN and the app will use {PROJECT_ID}.firebaseapp.com

# SSO setup (Supabase Dashboard + Microsoft Entra ID):
#
# STEP 1 — Microsoft Entra ID (Azure Portal)
#   1. Azure Portal → Microsoft Entra ID → App registrations → New registration
#   2. Name: AIMPLIFY
#   3. Supported account types: "Accounts in this organizational directory only" (single tenant)
#   4. Redirect URI — IMPORTANT: choose platform type **Web** (NOT Single-page application):
#      https://<YOUR-PROJECT-REF>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#   5. Copy Application (client) ID
#   6. Certificates & secrets → New client secret → copy the **Value** (NOT the Secret ID)
#   7. Manifest → optionalClaims → add email claim (see Supabase Azure docs)
#
# STEP 2 — Supabase Dashboard
#   1. Authentication → Providers → Azure → Enable
#   2. Azure Client ID = Application (client) ID from step 1
#   3. Azure Secret = secret **Value** from step 1 (never the Secret ID)
#   4. Azure Tenant URL (single-tenant InfoVision):
#      https://login.microsoftonline.com/<YOUR-TENANT-ID>
#   5. Authentication → URL Configuration:
#      Site URL: http://localhost:5173
#      Redirect URLs:
#        - http://localhost:5173/auth/callback
#        - https://<your-production-domain>/auth/callback
#
# TROUBLESHOOTING "Unable to exchange external code"
#   - Redirect URI in Azure must be **Web** platform, pointing to supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#   - Client secret in Supabase must be the secret Value, not Secret ID
#   - Tenant URL must match your Entra app (single-tenant vs common)
#   - Regenerate client secret if unsure, update Supabase, retry sign-in
#
# STEP 3 — Environment variables (.env.local)
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<YOUR-PROJECT-REF>.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=<your-anon-or-publishable-key>
#
# STEP 4 — Database (optional, for user profiles on SSO sign-in)
#   Run supabase/migrations/20260617_auth_profiles_trigger.sql in Supabase SQL editor
#
# TESTING
#   - Demo login: use email form on /login (any @infovision.com email, password not verified)
#   - SSO login: click "Sign in with Microsoft" (requires Steps 1–3 above)
